--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -27,8 +27,8 @@ python3 -m todo.cli --data data/todos.json list
 
 | Method | Path | 說明 |
 |---|---|---|
-| GET | `/api/todos` | 列出全部：`{"todos": [{"id", "title", "done", "due", "created_at", "overdue"}]}` |
-| POST | `/api/todos` | 新增：body `{"title": "...", "due": "YYYY-MM-DD"}`（due 可省略），回 201 `{"todo": {...}}` |
+| GET | `/api/todos` | 列出全部：`{"todos": [{"id", "title", "done", "due", "priority", "created_at", "overdue"}]}` |
+| POST | `/api/todos` | 新增：body `{"title": "...", "due": "YYYY-MM-DD", "priority": "high"}`（due、priority 可省略；priority 是 `high`／`normal`／`low`，預設 `normal`），回 201 `{"todo": {...}}` |
 | POST | `/api/todos/<id>/done` | 標記完成，回 `{"todo": {...}}` |
 | DELETE | `/api/todos/<id>` | 刪除，回 204 |
 
